    dcterms:title "EcoSKOS: stopgap vocabulary for ecological evidence annotation"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Terms that annotators need for ecological causal-evidence annotation (Causal Mosaic, CAMO) but that no ontology yet defines. Each term is a placeholder and a request: its broader term says where an ontology editor would place it, and it is mapped to the ontology term once one exists."@en ;
